{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors... but this time, it\u2019s in the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle and compete with your friends online in a fast-paced, chaotic party experience! Discover various game modes, multiple maps, character costumes, and powerful special abilities waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase one while escaping the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Party</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with your friends or players from all over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Abilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, dash, slide, and spit! These are your core skills. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various abilities from the map and use them tactically. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience points and gain an advantage with your character's special ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a team or duel one-on-one. Compete and have fun with mission and contest-based modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exciting mechanics across different maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena has unique environmental elements, use them smartly to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Costumes &amp; Accessories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your costume and shape your character. Battle by reflecting your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph